    {
      "id": "MESSAGEVALVETRONIK",
      "ita": "Il segnale di chiave (filo rosso/bianco) deve essere assente nel caso che i il motore sia spento anche se la chiave è in posizione ON. \\nIn caso di incidente l’interruttore inerziale o il segnale di crash devono disabilitare il segnale di chiave.",
      "eng": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "fra": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "deu": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "spa": "La señal de contacto+12V (cable blanco/rojo) tiene que ser absente si el motor estáapagado pero la llave estáen posicion ON. \\nEn caso de accidente la señal de contacto +12V tiene que ser deactivada por el sensor inertial o el sensor de crash del vehiculo",
      "por": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "pol": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "ned": "Het 12V na contact (rood/witte draad) moet wegvallen als de motor niet draait, zelfs als het contact nog aan staat . \\nIn het geval van een ongeluk zal de 'crash sensor' de 12V na contact moeten onderbreken.",
      "hun": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "rom": "Semnalul de +12 prin contact (firul alb/roșu) trebuie deconectat în cazul în care motorul se oprește și contactul este pus. \\nÎn cazul unui accident alimentarea de +12 prin contact trebuie să fie întreruptă de către comutatorul inerțial sau de senzorul de accident al autoturismului.",
      "far": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "rus": "Сигнал замка зажигания (бело-красный провод) должен поступать даже при выключенном двигателе и включенном зажигании./n При несчастном случае инерциальный датчик в любом случае должен отключить такой сигнал.",
      "tur": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "heb": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "bul": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "chn": "在发动机停转时即使点火开关处于打开状态 +12V 白/红）开关信号线必须断电. 当车辆发生事故时+12V信号由碰撞开关控制断电",
      "ara": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "ser": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "cze": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "gre": "The +12 key-on signal (white/red wire) must be shut down in the case the engine is off even if the ignition key is ON. \\nIn the event of crash the +12 key-on has to be shut off by the inertial switch or crash sensor of the car.",
      "tha": "สัญญาณจุดระเบิด+12 (สายไฟสีขาว/แดง) ต้องถูกปิดในกระณีที่เครื่องยนต์ดับ ถึงแม้ว่าสัญลักษณ์ตัวจุดระเบิดจะเปิดอยุ่ก็ตาม /ในกรณีการcrash สัญญาณ+12หลังจากตัวจุดระเบิดทำงาน จะต้องถูกปิดโดยสวิตซ์Inertial หรือ crashเซนเซอร์ของรถยนต์",
      "geo": "ანთების გასაღების სიგნალი (თეთრი/წითელი მავთული) უნდა მიეწოდებოდეს მაშინაც კი, როდესაც ძრავი გამორთულია და ანთების გასაღები ღიაა .ინერციულმა სენსორმა ნებისმიერ ავარიულ შემთხვევაში უნდა გათიშოს ეს სიგნალი."
    },
