    {
      "id": "HINTACCENSIONE",
      "ita": "Una volta settato l'esatto numero di cilindri, l'informazione viene utilizzata dalla centralina per calcolare correttamente il regime motore a partire dal periodo letto sull'ingresso giri.\\nSi seleziona MONOBOBINA se la vettura ha una bobina per ogni cilindro e il segnale è prelevato dal negativo o dal pilotaggio (transistor) della bobina. \\nSi seleziona BIBOBINA se la vettura ha una bobina che pilota due cilindri e il segnale è prelevato dal negativo o dal pilotaggio (transistor) della bobina. \\nSi usa l'opzione CONTAGIRI nel caso in cui il filo sia collegato al contagiri originale dell’auto con motore a 4 cilindri",
      "eng": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "fra": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "deu": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "spa": "Una vez que se háseleccionado el corecto número de cilindros, la informacion es utilizada por la UCE para calcular precisamente el número de vueltas del motor según el periodo leido en la entrada de la señal de RPM. \\nMONOBOBINA es por coches con una bobina para cada cilindro y señal tomada desde el negativo o desde el transistor de la bobina. \\nBIBOBINA es por coches con una bobina que comanda dos cindros y señal tomada desde el negativo o desde el transistor de la bobina. \\nLa opción CUENTARREVOLUCIONES es utilizada si el cable estáconectado al cuentarrevoluciones original de un coche 4 cilindros",
      "por": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "pol": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "ned": "Als het juiste aantal cilinders is ingevoerd, Kan de ECU het juiste toerental berekenen aan de hand van de puls die hij als input krijgt op de toerentaldraad. \\nENKELE BOBINE wordt geselecteerd als de motor een enkele bobine heeft voor elke cilinder en het signaal gepakt wordt bij de min of de transistor van de bobine. \\nDUBBELE BOBINE wordt geselecteerd als een bobine twee twee cilinders bedient en het signaal gepakt wordt bij de min of de transistor van de bobine . \\nDe TOERENTELLER optie wordt gebruikt als de draad aangesloten wordt bij de originele toerenteller van de auto met een 4 cilinder motor.",
      "hun": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "rom": "Odată cu selectarea numărului corect de cilindri, UEC folosește această infomație pentru a calcula corect turația motorului pornind de la semnalul de turație primit. \\nMONOBOBINĂ este selectat dacă motorul are o bobină pentru fiecare cilindru și semnalul este preluat de la negativ sau de la tranzistorul bobinei. \\nBOBINĂ DUBLĂ este selectat dacă motorul are o bobină ce acționează doi cilindri și semnalul este preluat de la negativ sau de la tranzistorul bobinei. \\nOpțiunea CONTOR DE TURAȚIE este folosită dacă firul de semnal este conectat la contorul de turație al motorului cu 4 cilindri.",
      "far": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "rus": "После того как вы установите точное количество цилиндров, информация используется блоком управления двигателем для расчитывания правильный режим работы двигателя начиная с периодом считывания оборотов при заводке.\\nвыбор одной катушки если двигатели имеет одну катушку на цилиндр и сигнал берется от минуса катушки или от сигнального провода. \\nдвойная катушка выбирается если двигатель управляется одной катушкой на двух цилиндрах сигнал берется от минуса катушки или от сигнального провода \\nопция ТАХОМЕТР используется в случае если провод подключен к тахометру для автомобилей 4 цилиндра",
      "tur": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "heb": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "bul": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "chn": "当选择了正确的气缸数量后,ECU才会根据输入信号来正确计算转速. \\n单缸点火是用于每缸一个点火线圈其信号来自线圈负极或来自线圈放大器. \\n双点火用于一个点火线圈用于两个气缸的车辆，其信号来自点火线圈负极或者是来自点火线圈放大器. \\n转速表选项用于将信号线连接到原四缸发动机车型的转速表",
      "ara": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "ser": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "cze": "Po zadání počtu válců ŘJ vypočítá správné ot. motoru. Jednoduchá zapal. cívka - pro každý válec jedna cívka, dvojitá zapal cívka - pro dva válce jedna zapal. cívka. Možnost otáčkoměr u 4 válce v případě že je drát připojen k původnímu otáčkoměru.",
      "gre": "Once the right number of cylinders is set, the information is used by the ECU to correctly calculate the engine revs starting from the period read on the revs input. \\nSINGLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil for each cylinder and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nDOUBLE IGNITION COIL is selected if the car has a coil that operates two cylinders and the signal is taken from the negative or transistor of the coil. \\nThe REV-COUNTER option is used if the wire is connected to the original rev-counter of the car with 4-cylinder engine",
      "tha": "เมื่อตั้งค่าจำนวนของกระบอกสูบแล้ว ข้อมูลจะถูกECUคำนวณเป็นรอบของเครื่องยนต์/SINGLE IGNITION COIL จะถูกเลือกเมื่อรถยนต์มีหนึ่งคอยล์ต่อหนึ่งกระบอกสูบและสัญญาณถูกนำมาจากด้านลบหรือทรานซิสเตอร์ของคอยล์ \\DOUBLE IGNITION COIL จะถูกเลือกเมื่อหนึ่งคอยล์ทำงานต่อสองกระบอกสูบและสัญญาณถูกนำมาจากด้านลบหรือทรานซิสเตอร์ของคอยล์ \\The REV-COUNTER ตัวเลือกนี้จะถูกใช้เมื่อต่อสัญญาณจากตัวส่งสัญญาณวัดรอบโดยตรงของรถยนต์ที่มีสี่กระบอกสูบ",
      "geo": "После того как вы установите точное количество цилиндров, информация используется блоком управления двигателем для расчитывания правильный режим работы двигателя начиная с периодом считывания оборотов при заводке.\\nвыбор одной катушки если двигатели имеет одну катушку на цилиндр и сигнал берется от минуса катушки или от сигнального провода. \\nдвойная катушка выбирается если двигатель управляется одной катушкой на двух цилиндрах сигнал берется от минуса катушки или от сигнального провода \\nопция ТАХОМЕТР используется в случае если провод подключен к тахометру для автомобилей 4 цилиндра"
    },
    {
      "id": "HINTCAMBIO",
      "ita": "La funzione permette di decidere se effettuare il passaggio benzina/gas durante la fase di accelerazione oppure di decelerazione. \\nLa scelta può essere dettata dalle caratteristiche della vettura o da particolari richieste del proprietario",
      "eng": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "fra": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "deu": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "spa": "La funcion permite de establecer si efectuar el cambio gasolina-gas en fase de aceleración o de deceleración. \\nSe puede elegir según las caracteristicas de cada vehiculo o quizás según especifica solicitud del dueño del coche.",
      "por": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "pol": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "ned": "Met deze functie kunt u selecteren of er in acceleratie of deceleratie overschakeld wordt naar gas. \\n Afhankelijk van de eigenschappen van de auto, of op verzoek van de klant maakt men deze keuze",
      "hun": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "rom": "Această funcție permite posibilitatea de trecere de pe benzină pe gpl în accelerare sau decelerare. \\n Alegerea poate fi facută pe baza caracteristicilor motorului sau pe baza solicitărilor posesorului de autoturism",
      "far": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "rus": "функция позволяющея выбрать переход с бензина на газ в режиме поднятия или снижения оборотов. \\nвыбор зависит от характеристик автомобиля или от желания хозяина",
      "tur": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "heb": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "bul": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "chn": "此选项选择加速过程中转换还是减速过程中转换. \\n也可以根据车辆特点或者用户的特殊要求来选择",
      "ara": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "ser": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
      "cze": "Tato funkce Vám umožní rozhodnout zda během zrychlování/zpomalování bude přeínáno z LPG/CNG. Volba může být dána vlastnotmi vozu nebo na žádost vlastníka.",
      "gre": "The function allows to select if petrol/gas changeover will be made in acceleration or deceleration. \\n The choice can be made based on the characteristics of the car or particular request form the owner of the car",
