    {
      "id": "HINTSTARTANDSTOP",
      "ita": "La strategia viene abilitata sui veicoli Start&Stop o su vetture nelle quali il segnale alle bobine venga a mancare durante lo stato di cutoff. \\nDopo la perdita del segnale giri il sistema rimane in modalità gas (commutatore verde) fino al mantenimento del segnale +15V sul filo bianco/rosso. \\nÈ indispensabile collegare il filo bianco/rosso ad un sottochiave presente anche in condizioni di vettura spenta e quadro acceso. \\nIn caso di urto l’inerziale deve comunque disabilitare tale segnale.",
      "eng": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "fra": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "deu": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "spa": "Esta strategia tiene que ser activada en coches con funcionalidad Start&Stop y tambien en coches que pierden señal de vueltas en fase de cutoff. \\nDespues que se háperdido la señal de RPM el sistema queda en modo gas (conmutador en posición gas) hasta que hay +15V al cable blanco/rojo system still operate in gas mode (green switch). \\nLa señal de contacto (cable blanco/rojo)tiene que ser presente cuando el motor estáapagado pero la llave estáen posición ON. \\nEn caso de accidente esta señal tiene que ser inhabilidada por el sensor inercial del coche.",
      "por": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "pol": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "ned": "Deze strategie kan geactiveerd worden bij Start&Stop voertuigen en ook bij voertuigen waarbij het toerental wegvalt tijdens fuel cut-off. \\n Als het toerental signaal wegvalt blijft de ECU in de gasstand staan (groene LED op de schakelaar) Zolang er 12V aanwezig is op de rood/wite draad. \\n Het 12V na contact signaal (rood/witte draad) moet aanwezig zijn als de motor uit staat met het contact aan. \\nIn het geval van een ongeluk, moet de originele crash sensor dit signaal onderbreken, controleer dit!!!.",
      "hun": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "rom": "Această strategie trebuie activată pe autoturismele cu sistemul Start&Stop și pe cele care prezintă pierderea semnalului de turație în timpul fazei de cutoff. \\nDupă pierderea semnalului deturație această opțiune permite sistemului funcționarea pe gpl (ledul verde de la comutator) cu condiția alimentării de +15V pe firul roșu/alb. \\nSemnalul de plus prin contact (firul roșu/alb ) trebuie să fie prezent chiar și atunci când motorul este oprit iar contactul este pus. \\nÎn cazul unui accident, senzorul de mișcare(inerțial) dezactivează acest semnal.",
      "far": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "rus": "функцию включить на автомобилях Start&Stop или на автомобилях где сигнал оборотов пропадает в режиме cutoff. \\nпосле потери сигнала оборотов автомобиль все-таки остаётся в режиме газ пока существует зажигание +15V на бело-красном проводе. \\nв таких случаев необходимо подключить бело-красный провод на провод где есть сигнал даже при отключеном двигателе с вкл. зажигание. \\n в случае аварии данный сигнал должен исчезнуть.",
      "tur": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "heb": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "bul": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "chn": "在带有“启停”功能或者是减速断油过程中没有转速信号的车上必须启用这个功能. \\n在失去转速信号后，直到白/红线上出现+15V电压之前，系统继续保持在燃气模式(转换开关绿色指示灯亮). \\n包括点火开关打开而发动机处于停转时，点火开关打开信号(白/红线)必须保持有电压信号. \\n如遇交通事故，碰撞传感器必须将该信号切断.",
      "ara": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "ser": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "cze": "Strategie START/STOP a pro vozidla s nepřesnými otáčkami během cutoff . Systém stále pracuje na plyn (přepínač je zelený) do +15V je přítomen bílo/červený drát. Signál od klíčku (bílo/červený drát) musí být zapojen i když je motor vypnut. Případně ho odpojí nárazové čidlo.",
      "gre": "This strategy must be enable on Start&Stop vehicles and also on vehicles in which RPM signal get loose during cutoff state. \\nAfter lossing of RPM signal system still operates in gas mode (green switch) until the +15V on white/red wire is present. \\nThe key-on signal (white/red wire) must be present even when the engine is off and ignition key is turned on. \\nIn case of accident the inertial sensor must disable this signal.",
      "tha": "ระบบนี้จะสามารถใช้ได้กับระบบStart&Stopของรถยนต์ รวมถึงรถยนต์ที่สัญญาณวัดรอบเครื่องยนต์จะหายไปในกรณีของการCut-off /หลังจากสัญญาณวัดรอบเครื่องยนต์หายนั้น ระบบจะคงทำงานอยู่ในระบบแก๊ส (ไฟสวิตซ์สีเขียว) จนสายไฟสีขาว/แดงมี +15Vเกิดขึ้น /สัญญาณของสายไฟขาว/แดง จะเปิดถึงแม้เครื่องยนต์จะปิดการทำงานและสัญญาณการจุดระเบิดเปิด /ในกรณีที่เกิดเหตุฉุกเฉิน เซนเซอร์inertialจะหยุดการทำงานของสัญญาณนี",
      "geo": "функцию включить на автомобилях Start&Stop или на автомобилях где сигнал оборотов пропадает в режиме cutoff. \\nпосле потери сигнала оборотов автомобиль все-таки остаётся в режиме газ пока существует зажигание +15V на бело-красном проводе. \\nв таких случаев необходимо подключить бело-красный провод на провод где есть сигнал даже при отключеном двигателе с вкл. зажигание. \\n в случае аварии данный сигнал должен исчезнуть."
    },
