    {
      "id": "HINTRITARDOCAMBIO",
      "ita": "La gestione del ritardo per il passaggio benzina-gas avviene in base alla temperatura del liquido raffreddamento motore del veicolo. \\nEssa può essere rilevata dal sensore presente sul tubo riscaldamento del riduttore o direttamente sul sensore originale del motore. \\nTale ritardo è gestibile per mezzo di una stringa in cui è possibile associare a ciascuna determinata temperatura un tempo di ritardo. \\nLa ECU rileva al sottochiave la temperatura acqua istantanea abilitando il passaggio benzina-gas una volta che sia trascorso \\nil ritardo impostato e siano verificate le condizioni sul tipo di passaggio e sulla soglia giri.",
      "eng": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "fra": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "deu": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "spa": "El retrazo para el cambio gasolina-gas estámanejado según la temperatura del agua motor.\\nEsta temperatura puede ser leida por el sensor externo puesto en la linea de calientamento del reductor o directamente desde el sensor original del motor. \\nEl retrazo puede ser establecido con un vector donde es posible fijar un retrazo para cada valor de temperatura motor. La UCE lee el valor instantaneo de temperatura motor al arranque y habilita el cambio a gas una vez que hápasado el correspondiente retrazo fijado a esa temperatura y ademas estan verificadas condicciones sobre el tipo de cambio y el número de vueltas.",
      "por": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "pol": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "ned": "Regeling van de wachttijd voor het overschakelen naar gas is afhankelijk van de watertemperatuur. \\nDit kan gemeten worden door een externe motortemperatuursensor of op de originele motortemperatuursensor van de auto. \\nDe wachttijd kan ingegeven worden afhankelijk van de gemeten temperatuur. \\nDe ECU detecteert onmiddelijk bij het 'op contact zetten' de motortemperatuur en er zal overgeschakeld worden van benzine naar gas als de wachtijd verlopen is, de schakelaar op gas staat en het minimaal aantal toeren bereikt is",
      "hun": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "rom": "Gestionarea întârzierii la trecerea benzină-gpl este bazată pe senzorul de temperatură al motorului. \\nSemnalul poate fi preluat de la senzorul de temperatură montat pe furtunul de încălzire al reductorului sau direct dela senzorul original al motorului. \\nAceastă întârziere poate fi gestionată de o condiție ce poate asocia un timp de întârziere pentru fiecare temperatură dată. \\nUEC detectează instantaneu temperatura la punerea contactului, activând trecerea de pe benzină pe gpl când întârzierea setată a expirat și atunci când condițiile de trecere în funcție de pragul de turație sunt verificate",
      "far": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "rus": "Управление задержкой для переключения с бензина на газа происходит в зависимости от температуры охлаждающей жидкости двигателя транспортного средства. \\nсчитывается от датчика непосредственно стоящий на нагревающем патрубке или непосредственно от автомобильного датчика. \\nэто задержка может управлятся с помощью строки где возможно ассоциировать при каждой температуре определенное время задержки. \\nЭБУ может определить даже при включение зажигания температуру воды и дает возможность завестись прямо на газ или подождать определенное время \\nзаданной задержкой и условия были удовлетворены от типа перехода и оборотов .",
      "tur": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "heb": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "bul": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "chn": "基于发动机水温信号来管控油气转换延时. \\n水温可以通过安装减压器水循环管路上的水温传感器或者是原车水温传感器来获取. \\n可以设定不同的时间数列来控制各温度下的转换延时. \\n启用油气转换水温延时控制功能，打开点火开关时，ECU可以读取到当时的水温,确定延时时间，并结合转速和加减速工况识别来控制转换",
      "ara": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "ser": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "cze": "Řízení zpoždění pro přepnutí benzín-plyn probíhá na základě teploty chlacící kapaliny vozidla.Ta může být snímána čidlem na reduktoru,nebo původním čidlem. Toto zpoždění může být řetězeno, kdy každé teplotě může být přiřazeno zpoždění. Při zapnutí zapalování ŘJ zjistí okamžitou teplotu umožňující přepnutí benzín-plyn jakmile uplyne zpoždění a jsou ověřeny prahové otáčky a typ přepínače.",
      "gre": "Management of the petrol-gas switch delay is based on the engine water temperature. \\nIt can be detected by the sensor on the reducer heating pipe or directly on the original sensor of the engine. \\nThis delay can be managed by a string in which it is possible to associate a delay time with each given temperature. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous water temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch when the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "tha": "การจัดการการหน่วงของระบบเชื้อเพลิงน้ำมันเปลี่ยนเป็นแก๊ส เกิดขึ้นจากอุณหภูมิของน้ำหล่อเย็นในเครื่องยนต์ /จะถูกตรวจสอบโดยเซนเซอร์บนท่อร้อนของอุปกรณ์ลดความดันหรือจากเซนเซอร์ของเครื่องยนต์โดยตรง /การหน่วงนี้สามารถจัดการได้โดยทำงานร่วมกับการหน่วงเวลา /ECUจะตรวจสอบอุณหภูมิน้ำเมื่อเกิดการจุดระเบิด เปิดการทำงานของการเปลี่ยนเชื้อเพลิงตามที่ตั้งไว้ /เมื่อเวลาหน่วงผ่านไป และเงื่อนไขของระบบการสลับเชื้อเพลิงที่ตั้งไว้ และรอบเครื่องยนต์ที่ถูกต้อง",
      "geo": "Управление задержкой для переключения с бензина на газа происходит в зависимости от температуры охлаждающей жидкости двигателя транспортного средства. \\nсчитывается от датчика непосредственно стоящий на нагревающем патрубке или непосредственно от автомобильного датчика. \\nэто задержка может управлятся с помощью строки где возможно ассоциировать при каждой температуре определенное время задержки. \\nЭБУ может определить даже при включение зажигания температуру воды и дает возможность завестись прямо на газ или подождать определенное время \\nзаданной задержкой и условия были удовлетворены от типа перехода и оборотов ."
    },
    {
      "id": "HINTRITARDOCAMBIOGAS",
      "ita": "Nel caso in cui il sensore acqua non sia collegato la gestione del ritardo per il passaggio benzina-gas \\navviene in base alla temperatura del gas rilevata dal sensore gas presente sul rail iniettori.\\nLa ECU rileva al sottochiave la temperatura gas istantanea abilitando il passaggio benzina-gas una volta che sia trascorso \\nil ritardo impostato e siano verificate le condizioni sul tipo di passaggio e sulla soglia giri.",
      "eng": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "fra": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "deu": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "spa": "Si el sensor de temperatura no es utilizado, el cambio a gas estámanejado con la temperatura gas al arranque y el retrazo establedico desde el arranque. \\nEn el vector, para cada valor de temperatura gas tiene que ser fijado su proprio retrazo, de manera de obtener un normal calientamento del reductor. \\nLa UCE lee el valor instantaneo de temperatura gas al arranque y habilita el cambio a gas una vez que hápasado el correspondiente retrazo fijado a esa temperatura y ademas estan verificadas condicciones sobre tipo de cambio y número de vueltas.",
      "por": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "pol": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "ned": "Als de T-water sensor niet gebruikt wordt, dan wordt er overgeschakeld afhankelijk van de gastemperatuur. \\nIn de tabel moet er voor elke gastemperatuur een juiste wachttijd worden ingegeven, Om een goede verdampertemperauur te garanderen. \\nDe ECU detecteert onmiddelijk bij het 'op contact zetten' de motortemperatuur en er zal overgeschakeld worden van benzine naar gas als de wachtijd verlopen is, de schakelaar op gas staat en het minimaal aantal toeren bereikt is",
      "hun": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "rom": "Dacă nu se folosește un senzor de temperatură al sistemului gpl, trecerea pe gpl se bazează pe temperatura gpl-ului si pe timpul de întârziere de la pornirea motorului. \\nÎn tabel, pentru fiecare valoare a temperaturii de gpl este necesară setarea unui timp de întârziere, pentru a obține o preîncălzire necesară a reductorului. \\nUEC sesizează la punerea contactului temperatura gpl-ului, activând trecerea de la benzină la gpl în funcție de îndeplinirea condițiilor tipului de trecere și ale pragului de turație.",
      "far": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "rus": "в случае если датчик температуры не подключен то переход с опозданием с бензина на газ \\nпроисходит в базе температуры газ считываемая с датчика давления стоящий на форсунке.\\nЭБУ видит зажигание и температуру газ разрешая переход с бензина на газ когда произошло \\nзадержкаустановленая и были проверены все условия поставленные для перехода ,тип перехода обороты для перехода.",
      "tur": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "heb": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "bul": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "chn": "如果没有安装水温传感器,转换延时将会基于发动机启动起始的燃气温度\\n在对应的显示的参数对应减压器通常需要的加热时间时间ECU根据点火启动时的燃气温度，并在其他条件都满足时允许转换",
      "ara": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "ser": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "cze": "Pokud není použito teplotní čidlo vody je režim přepínání založen na počáteční teplotě plynu a času zpoždění od staru motoru. Pro každou hodnotu teploty lze v tabulce nastavit správné časové zpoždění aby bylo možné dosahnout normální předehřátí reduktoru. Při zapnutí zapalování ŘJ detekuje okamžitou teplotu vody umožˇující přepnutí jakmile uplyne zpoždění a jso potvrzeny podmínky pro přepnutí - typ přepínače a prahové otáčky.",
      "gre": "If the T-water sensor is not used, gas mode switchover is based on initial gas temperature and time delay from engine starting. \\nIn the table, for each gas temperature value should be set proper time delay, to obtain normal reducer pre-heating. \\nThe ECU detects the instantaneous gas temperature with the ignition on, enabling the petrol-gas switch once that the set delay has elapsed and the conditions on the type of switch and on the revs threshold are verified",
      "tha": "ถ้าไม่มีการทำงานของตัววัดอุณหภูมิน้ำ ระบบแก๊สจะเปลี่ยนได้ขึ้นอยู่กับอุณหภูมิแก๊ส และเวลาหน่วงหลังจากการสตาร์ทรถยนต์ ดังในตาราง สำหรับค่าของอุณหภิแก๊สแต่ละช่วงควรจะตั้งเวลาหน่วงอย่างเหมาะสม เพื่อการทำงานที่ปกติของอุปกรณ์ลดแรงดัน /ECUจะตรวจสอบอุณหภูมิของน้ำในทันทีเมื่อเกิดการจุดระเบิด เปิดการทำงานของการเปลี่ยนเชื้อเพลิงตามที่ตั้งไว้ /เมื่อเวลาหน่วงผ่านไป และเงื่อนไขของระบบการสลับเชื้อเพลิงที่ตั้งไว้ และรอบเครื่องยนต์ที่ถูกต้อง",
      "geo": "в случае если датчик температуры не подключен то переход с опозданием с бензина на газ \\nпроисходит в базе температуры газ считываемая с датчика давления стоящий на форсунке.\\nЭБУ видит зажигание и температуру газ разрешая переход с бензина на газ когда произошло \\nзадержкаустановленая и были проверены все условия поставленные для перехода ,тип перехода обороты для перехода."
    },
    {
      "id": "HINTISTANTANEOVALUE",
      "ita": "Numero di cicli di attesa per il passaggio sequenziale a gas dei vari cilindri. \\nAumentare il valore di default nel caso in cui si percepisca eccessivamente il passaggio a gas. \\nIn caso di sfasamento manuale della sequenza è necessario settare il valore a 0.",
      "eng": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "fra": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "deu": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "spa": "Esto es el número de inyeccionesáesperar para el paso a gas del cilindro siguiente. \\nUtilizar un valor mayor si el cambio a gas es irregular.\\nCuidado: si la secuencia gas es modificada manualmente este parametro tiene que ser puesto a 0.",
      "por": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "pol": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "ned": "Aantal cycli waarin er overgeschakeld wordt van benzine naar gas. \\nGebruik een hoge waarde als het overschakelen voelbaar is. \\nAls 'handmatig instellen van injectievolgorde' geselecteerd is, dan moet deze parameter op nul worden gezet.",
      "hun": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "rom": "Numărul de cicluri ale motorului pentru trecere pe gpl. \\nUtilizați o valoare mai mare dacă trecerea pe gpl este realizată cu probleme. \\nDacă secvența injectoarelor de gpl este activată, acest parametru trebuie să fie zero.",
      "far": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "rus": "число циклов в ожидании для последовательного перехода между цилиндрами . \\nпозволяет менять значения по умолчанию в случае неровного перехода на газ в случае ручного изменения последовательности значение по умолчаниию должна стоять в 0.",
      "tur": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "heb": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "bul": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "chn": "转换所需要的工作循环数量\\n如果转换太粗暴，就采用较高条件. \\n如果启用手动改变喷气顺序,这个参数必须设定为零.",
      "ara": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "ser": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "cze": "To je počet vstřiků před přepnutím na další válec. \\nPokud je změna příliš velká, použijte vyšší honotu. \\nPokud měníte pořadí vstřikování ručně, musíte nastavit tuto hodnotu 0.",
      "gre": "Number of engine cycles for petrol-gas changeover. \\nUse an higher value if the change-over is too rough. \\nIf manual gas injectors sequence is enalbled, this parameter has to be set to zero.",
      "tha": "จำนวนของกระบอกสูบที่ต้องรอในการเปลี่ยนเป็นระบบแก๊สในสูบถัดไป/ ใช้ค่าที่สูงถ้าการเปลี่ยนระบบเชื้อเพลิงสูงเกินไป/ถ้าเปลี่ยนด้วยตัวเองต้องตั้งค่าอยู่ที่0",
      "geo": "число циклов в ожидании для последовательного перехода между цилиндрами . \\nпозволяет менять значения по умолчанию в случае неровного перехода на газ в случае ручного изменения последовательности значение по умолчаниию должна стоять в 0."
