    {
      "id": "HINTBUTTONRICERCAPARAMETRI",
      "ita": "La funzione prevede la possibilità di impostare l'utilizzo del sensore MAP (pressione assoluta del collettore di aspirazione). \\nAttivandola compare automaticamente il pulsante di avvio della procedura di autoapprendimento per caratterizzare il sensore originale della vettura. \\nSi raccomanda di scegliere un sottochiave sicuro, poichè la prima parte dell'apprendimento avviene con motore spento e solamente key-on. \\nSe così non fosse la centralina non riceverebbe corrente e la procedura fallirebbe a causa dello spegnimento della ECU.",
      "eng": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "fra": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "deu": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "spa": "La funcion permite de fijar el utilizo del sensor MAP (presión absoluta del colector de admisión). \\nActivando esta función, apareceráautomaticamente el botón para empezar la procedura de aprendizaje automatico del sensor original del coche. \\nEs importante que la señal de contacto sea temporizada, de momento que la primera parte de la procedura seráecha sin la señal de vueltas; en esta condición la UCE no tiene que apagarse.",
      "por": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "pol": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "ned": "Met deze functie kunt u het gebruik van een MAP sensor activeren (absolute in het inlaatspruitstuk). \\nAls geactiveerd, dan zal de knop voor de 'zelf calibratie' verschijnen. \\nHet is belangrijk om een goede 12V na contact te hebben omdat het eerste gedeelte van de zelf calibratie gebeurt \\nzonder RPM signaal en de gas ECU moet dan niet uitgeschakeld worden.",
      "hun": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "rom": "Aceasta funcție permite setarea utilizării senzorului MAP (presiune absoluta din colectorul de admisie). \\nDupă activare, apare butonul de start al procedurii de autocalibrare al caracteristicii senzorului original. \\nEste important să existe un contact general, pentru prima parte a procedurii de autocalibrare \\nFără semnal de turație(RPM), UEC gpl nu pemite funcționarea.",
      "far": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "rus": "функция позволяющая включить использование датчика МAP (абсолютное давление всасывающего коллектора). \\nактивируя, автоматически появляется кнопка для начало процедуры по считыванию характеристики штатного датчика. \\nрекомендуется брать постояное зажигание, потому что первоначальное считывание происходит только с включенным зажиганием. \\nесли не было бы так то ЭБУ не имело достаточно тока для всей процедуры и блокируется за счет отключения ЭБУ",
      "tur": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "heb": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "bul": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "chn": "此项可以设定真空传感器特性参数(进气歧管的绝对压力). \\n启用后,传感器自适配启动按钮就会显现. \\n重点注意需要打开点火开关,这是因为自适配过程要求的\\n没有转速信号ECU不自动停止工作.",
      "ara": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "ser": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "cze": "Tato funkce předpokládá možnost nastavení použitého MAP senzoru (absolutní tlak v sacím potrubí). \\nPři jeho aktivaci se objeví tlačítko start procedury automatického nastavení originálnímu čidlu vozidla. \\nJe důležité mít jištěný klíček zapalování protože první část nastavení musí být provedena \\nbez zapnutého signálu otáček a plynová ŘJ nesmí být vypnuta.",
      "gre": "The function allows to set the use of the MAP sensor (absolute pressure of the intake manifold). \\nWhen activated, the start button of the self-learning procedure of original sensor characteristic automatically appears. \\nIs important to have a safe key-on, because the first part of the self-learning procedure has to be made \\nwithout RPM signal and the gas ECU doesn't have to switch off.",
      "tha": "ระบบนี้จะเป็นการคาดการณ์ถึงความเป็นไปได้ต่อการตั้งค่าการใช้งานของเซนเซอร์วัดแรงดันในท่อร่วม (แรงดันสมบูรณ์ในท่อร่วมไอดี) ในการเปิดใช้งาน ปุ่ม Start สำหรับการเรียนรู้ระบบและคุณลักษณะของเซนเซอร์ตัวเดิมที่ติดมากับรถยนต์แสดงขึ้น /สำคัญที่จะต้องให้กุญแจหมุนไปที่On เพราะในส่วนขั้นตอนแรกจะต้องมีขั้นตอนการเรียนรู้ /จะถูกทำขึ้นโดยไม่มีสัญญาณวัดรอบเครื่องยนต์ และECUของระบบแก๊สไม่จำเป็นที่จะต้องปิด",
      "geo": "функция позволяющая включить использование датчика МAP (абсолютное давление всасывающего коллектора). \\nактивируя, автоматически появляется кнопка для начало процедуры по считыванию характеристики штатного датчика. \\nрекомендуется брать постояное зажигание, потому что первоначальное считывание происходит только с включенным зажиганием. \\nесли не было бы так то ЭБУ не имело достаточно тока для всей процедуры и блокируется за счет отключения ЭБУ"
    },
