    {
      "id": "HINTDRAWGRIDK",
      "ita": "Questa tabella rappresenta la mappa principale di carburazione.\\nPer ciascuna combinazione di valori di giri motore-tempo iniezione benzina è riportato il fattore \\n(denominato con la lettera K) che, inserito all'interno della catena di calcolo, permette di determinare i tempi iniezione GAS. \\nE' possibile modificare ciascun parametro presente all'interno della tabella cliccando due volte sulla relativa casella.",
      "eng": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "fra": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "deu": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "spa": "Esta tabla representa la mapa principal de carburación. \\nEl factór (nombrado con letra K)The factor (named with the letter K) es fijado para cada combinación de tiempo de inyeccion gasolina y número de vueltas\\nEste factor, puesto en la cadena de calculo, permite a la UCE de determinar el corecto tiempo de inyeccion gas. \\nEs posible modificar este parametro en tabla haciendo doble-clic en la celula correspondiente.",
      "por": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "pol": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "ned": "Met dit kenveld wordt de hoofd mengselregeling bepaald. \\nDe factor (genaamd letter K) wordt opgegeven voor elk toerental(RPM) en belasting (benzine injectie tijd) \\nDeze waarde wordt vervolgens in een formule gebruikt om de juiste gas injectie tijd te berekenen. \\nHet is mogelijk om elke parameter in het kenveld aan te paassen door te dubbelklikken op de cel/",
      "hun": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "rom": "Acest tabel reprezintă matricea principală de carburație. \\nFactorul (notat cu litera K) este furnizat pentru fiecare combinație de valori ale turației motorului-timp de injecție de benzină\\n care fiind pus în lanțul de calcul, permite determinarea timpului de injecție de gpl. \\nEste posibil să înlocuiești fiecare parametru din interiorul matricei prin dublu clic pe zona relevanță.",
      "far": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "rus": "Эта таблица представляет собой основную карту смесеобразования. \\ nДля каждой комбинации значений времени впрыска обороты двигателя газ показана фактором \\ n(называемый с буквы К), которая, вставляется в цепочке расчетов, позволяет определить время впрыска газа. \\ nЭто может изменить каждый параметр в этой таблице, дважды щелкнув на соответствующем поле.",
      "tur": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "heb": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "bul": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "chn": "这个界面呈现混合比参数修正图表. \\n该系数(以字母K命名的)用于根据发动机转速和喷油时间来确定的工况点\\n每个数据时用于确定对应工况点的喷气时间. \\n点击每个表格可以修改其中对应的参数.",
      "ara": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "ser": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "cze": "Tato tabulka představuje hlavní mapu karburace. \\nFaktor (pojmenovaný písmenem K) je uveden pro každou kombinaci otáček vstřikovacího benzínového času \\nlkterý umožní vložit vypočtený řetězec dle plynových vstřikovacích časů. \\nDvojitým kliknutím na příslušné políčko je možné měnit jednotlivé parametry v tabulce.",
      "gre": "This table represents the main carburation map. \\nThe factor (named with the letter K) is given for each combination of values of engine revs-petrol injection time \\nwhich put inside the calculation chain allows the GAS injection times to be determined. \\nIt is possible to change each parameter inside the table by double-clicking the relevant box.",
      "tha": "ตารางนี้แสดงค่าหลักของcarburation map /ตัวแปร (ชื่อประกอบด้วยK) จะถูกรวมกับค่าความเร็วรอบของเครื่องยนต์-เวลาหัวฉีดน้ำมัน /ซึ่งจะถูกใส่ในการคำนวณและจะสามารถบอกระยะเวลาของหัวฉีดแก๊สได้ /จะสามารถเปลี่ยนค่าแต่ละค่าในตารางได้โดยdouble-clicking ในกรอบที่เกี่ยวข้อง",
      "geo": "Эта таблица представляет собой основную карту смесеобразования. \\ nДля каждой комбинации значений времени впрыска обороты двигателя газ показана фактором \\ n(называемый с буквы К), которая, вставляется в цепочке расчетов, позволяет определить время впрыска газа. \\ nЭто может изменить каждый параметр в этой таблице, дважды щелкнув на соответствующем поле."
    },
