      "fra": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "deu": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "spa": "Este parametro es el tiempo minimo que necesitan inyectores para abrir. \\nISi la cadena de calculo genera un tiempo minor de este valor, será reemplazado por el tiempo minimo.",
      "por": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "pol": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "ned": "Dit is de minimale openingstijd van de gas injector. \\nals de formule een injectie tijd berekent die lager is dan de minimale openingstijd, dan zal deze vervangen worden door laatstgenoemde",
      "hun": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "rom": "Acest parametru reprezintă timpul minim de deschidere al injectoarelor. \\nDacă lanțul de calcul generează un timp mai mic decât cel implementat, acesta va fi înlocuit cu valoarea implementată",
      "far": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "rus": "параметр показывает мин время открытия газ форсунки . \\nесли цепь расчетов времени меньше чем по умолчанию, то измените параметр",
      "tur": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "heb": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "bul": "This parameter is the minimum opening time of the injectors. \\nIf the calculation chain generates a time less than this latter one, it is replaced with this value",
      "chn": "这个参数是喷嘴开启的最新时间. \\n如果计算出来的喷射时间少于该时间,将会按照该设定的时间执行",
