    {
      "id": "HINTRADIORIENTRO",
      "ita": "Questa strategia prevede che venga eseguito il rientro al minimo a benzina se si hanno problemi di spegnimento del motore. \\nIl commutatore rimane in modalità gas senza avvisare l’utente del funzionamento a benzina. \\nModificando i parametri inseriti è possibile anche far intervenire la strategia solamente in caso di sottoregime.",
      "eng": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "fra": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "deu": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "spa": "Estra strategia permite de volver temporalmente a gasolina al ralenti (por debajo de un umbral establecido de RPM) y luego volver a gas. \\nPodria ser de ayuda si hay problemas a la vuelta al ralenti. El conmutador se queda en gas. \\nUtilizando un valor bajo de este umbral de RPM es posible utilizar esta strategia para undershoot.",
      "por": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "pol": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "ned": "Met deze strategie schakelt hij stationair tijdelijk terug naar benzine (onder een bepaalde drempelwaarde (RPM)) daarna schakelt hij weer over naar gas. \\nDit kan handig zijn voor auto's die afslaan bij afremmen van de motor. De schakelaar blijft in de gasmodus. \\nAls je een laag toerental instelt, dan kan je het gebruken om 'instorten v/d motor' te voorkomen.",
      "hun": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "rom": "Această strategie permite trecerea temporară pe benzină în ralanti(sub pragul setat de turație) și apoi revine pe gpl. \\nPoate fi utilizată dacă există probleme la revenirea în ralanti prin oprirea motorului. Comutatorul rămâne în poziția gpl. \\nFolosind o valoare scăzută a primului prag de turație este posibil să folosiți strategia doar pentru pentru diminuarea defectului.",
      "far": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "rus": "функция позволяющая возврат на бензин если имеются проблемы на холостых оборотах, двигатель глохнет. \\nпереключатель остается в режиме газ без уведомления пользователя что работает на бензине.. \\nИзменяя входные параметры также могут быть вовлечены только в случае минимума",
      "tur": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "heb": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "bul": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "chn": "回怠速时临时转到燃油运转(根据转速的设定)然后转回到燃气运行. \\n对于燃气运转时回怠速熄火有用，开关还显示燃气状态\\n如果为了解决这一问题，可以用一个较小的转速起始设定值.",
      "ara": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "ser": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "cze": "Tato strategie přepíná při volnoběhu dočasně na benzín (dle nastavené hodnoty otáček). \\nMůže být užitečná tam, kde je problém při běhu na volnoběh. Přepínač zůstává v plynu. \\nPoužití nižších prahových hodnot otáček je možné při použití této strategie.",
      "gre": "This strategy switches temporarly back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and then switches to gas. \\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas. \\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "tha": "ระบบนี้จะทำงานโดยจะเปลี่ยนไปใช้น้ำมันชั่วคราวเมื่อเครื่องยนต์เดินเบา(จากค่าของรอบเครื่องยนต์ที่ตั้งไว้) และจะเปลี่ยนกลับเป็นระบบแก๊ส /อาจจะเป็นประโยชน์เมื่อเกิดอาการดับในช่วงเดินเบา แต่สวิตซ์จะบอกว่าอยุ๋ในระบบแก๊ส /ถ้ารอบของเครื่องยนต์มีค่าต่ำ ระบบนี้จะสามารถช่วยไม่ให้รอบตกได้",
      "geo": "функция позволяющая возврат на бензин если имеются проблемы на холостых оборотах, двигатель глохнет. \\nпереключатель остается в режиме газ без уведомления пользователя что работает на бензине.. \\nИзменяя входные параметры также могут быть вовлечены только в случае минимума"
    },
    {
      "id": "HINTRADIOBENZINA",
      "ita": "Questa strategia prevede che venga eseguito il retropassaggio a benzina al minimo se si hanno problemi di spegnimento del motore. \\nIl commutatore rimane in modalità gas senza avvisare l’utente dell’avvenuto retropassaggio, tramite lampeggio del led, \\nfino a quando non venga superata la soglia giri motore di rientro a gas \\nper cui il motore riprende a funzionare in modalità gas. \\nModificando i parametri inseriti è possibile anche far intervenire la strategia solamente in caso di sottoregime.",
      "eng": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "fra": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "deu": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "spa": "Esta strategia vuelve a gasolina al ralenti (por debajo de un umbral de vueltas) y cambia a gas cuando superas ese umbral. Puede ser de ayuda cuando hay problemas al ralenti. El conmutador se queda en gas. Utilizando un valor bajo de este umbral se puede utilizar la strategia para undershoots",
      "por": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "pol": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "ned": "Met deze strategie schakelt hij stationair terug naar benzine (onder een bepaalde drempelwaarde (RPM)) hij schakelt hij weer over naar gas boven de opgegeven drempelwaarde. \\nDit kan handig zijn voor auto's die afslaan bij afremmen van de motor. De schakelaar blijft in de gasmodus. \\nAls je een laag toerental instelt, dan kan je het gebruken om 'instorten v/d motor' te voorkomen.",
      "hun": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "rom": "această strategie permite trecerea pe benzină în ralanti (sub pragul setat de turație) și revenirea pe gpl în momentul depășirii pragului de turație.\\nPoate fi folositoare în momentul în care există probleme de oprire a motorului în ralanti. Comutatorul rămâne în poziția gpl.\\nFolosinf o valoare redusă a primului prag de turație este posibilă folosirea acestei strategii doar pentru diminuarea defectului.",
      "far": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "rus": "стратегия позволяющая работу двигателя на бензин на холостых оборотах при разных проблемах/переключатель остается в режиме газ без уведомления пользователя что работает на бензине, \\nпока не превысят значение установленых оборотах \\n после которых двигатель начинает работать на газ/nИзменяя входные параметры также могут быть вовлечены только в случае минимума",
      "tur": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "heb": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "bul": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "chn": "此选项是怠速回燃油(在设定的转速之下)和超过转速自动转到燃气的策略.\\n这个也许对燃气运转时回怠速熄火的问题有用. 开关显示为燃气状态.\\n，如果为了解决这一问题，可以用一个较小的转速起始设定值.",
      "ara": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "ser": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "gre": "This strategy switch back to petrol in idle (under a set value of RPM) and switch to gas when you pass the RPM threshold.\\nIt could be useful if there are problems of turning off in idle. The switch remain on gas.\\nUsing a low value of the first RPM threshold it is possible to use this strategy just for undershoot.",
      "tha": "ระบบนี้จะทำงานโดยจะเปลี่ยนไปใช้น้ำมันเมื่อเครื่องยนต์เดินเบา (จากค่าของรอบเครื่องยนต์ที่ตั้งไว้) และจะเปลี่ยนกลับเป็นระบบแก๊สเมื่อผ่านค่ารอบเครื่องยนต์ที่ตั้งไว้ /จะมีประโยชน์ถ้ามีปัญหาการดับในรอบเดินเบา แต่สวิตซ์จะบอกว่าอยุ๋ในระบบแก๊ส /ถ้ารอบของเครื่องยนต์มีค่าต่ำ ระบบนี้จะสามารถช่วยไม่ให้รอบตกได้",
      "geo": "стратегия позволяющая работу двигателя на бензин на холостых оборотах при разных проблемах/переключатель остается в режиме газ без уведомления пользователя что работает на бензине, \\nпока не превысят значение установленых оборотах \\n после которых двигатель начинает работать на газ/nИзменяя входные параметры также могут быть вовлечены только в случае минимума"
    },
