    {
      "id": "HINTSPLITFUEL",
      "ita": "Per ogni valore di Pgas nel vettore il valore percentuale inserito rappresenta il numero d’iniettate benzina sul singolo cilindro eseguite ogni 100 iniettate sul cilindro stesso. \\nLa centralina inietta ciclicamente benzina su un cilindro alla volta. Utilizzando il valore massimo della percentuale di “split” (25%) \\nun cilindro sarà ciclicamente sempre alimentato a benzina. \\n Esempio: impostando 10% si alimenta a benzina progressivamente un solo cilindro per volta per 10 iniettate, \\npoi si alimenta il cilindro a gas per le restanti 90 iniettate.",
      "eng": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "fra": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "deu": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "spa": "Para cada valor de la presión gas, el porcentaje representa el número de inyecciones de gasolina echas en cada cilindro cada 100 inyecciones en el mismo cilindro. \\nPeriodicamente, la UCE inyecta gasolina en cada cilindro. utilizando el porcentaje maximo de \"split\" (25%) ciclicamente un cilindro serásiempre alimentado con gasolina. \\nEjemplo: utilizando el 10% cada cilindro seráalimentado con gasolina para 10 inyecciones, y luego seráalimentado con gas en las siguientes 90 inyecciones.",
      "por": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "pol": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "ned": "Voor elke gasdruk waarde geeft het percentage het aantal benzineinjecties voor elke cilinder bij elke 100 injecties op die cilinder weer. \\nPeriodiek injecteert de ECU benzine op elke cilinder. Bij een maximaal “split” percentage (25%) zal er elke cycle een cilinder benzine injecteren. \\nVoorbeeld: bij 10% 'split' zal elke cilinder 10 injecties benzine krijgen daarna zal hij de laatste 90 injecties gas krijgen.",
      "hun": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "rom": "Pentru fiecare valoare a presiunii de gpl procentul prezintă numărul de injecții de benzină realizate pentru fiecare cilindru la 100 injecții pe cilindru respectiv. \\nPeriodic UEC injectează benzină în fiecare cilindru. Utilizând valoarea procentului maxim de “partajare”(25%) un cilindru va primi doar benzină în fiecare ciclu de funcționare al motorului. \\nDe exemplu: folosind 10%, fiecare cilindru va primi timp de 10 injecții doar benzină, după care acel cilindru va fi alimentat cu gpl pentru următoarele 90 de injecții.",
      "far": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "rus": "Для каждого значения в векторе PGAS процентное значение введено представляет собой количество впрыскиваемого топлива в каждый цилиндр каждые 100 впрысков, выполняемые на том же цилиндре. \\nБлок управления впрыскивает бензин периодически на цилиндр в отдельности, использовая максимальное значение в процентах для split” (25%) \\nпериодически в каждый цикл один цилиндр будет работать и на бензине. \\n пример если поставить значение 10% то подаётся бензин прогрессивно только в один цилиндр в течение 10 впрысков \\nостальное наполняется газом 90 впрысков",
      "tur": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "heb": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "bul": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "chn": "各压力对应的百分比显示某个气缸在100个燃油喷射信号过程中燃油喷嘴开启喷油数量. \\nECU周期性的给对应的气缸喷射燃油.最大的间隙燃油替换百分比(25%)意味着始终有一缸才喷射燃油. \\n例如:设定10%则某一个气缸燃油喷嘴开启10次,然后该气缸将转到燃油喷嘴开启90次.",
      "ara": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "ser": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "cze": "Pro každou hodnotu tlaku plynu je procenticky ukázán počet benzínových vstřiků na každý válec při 100 vstřicích. \\nŘJ pravidelně vstřikuje benzín do každého jednotlivého válce. Použitím max. rozdělení procentické hodnoty (25%) bude jeden válec opakovaně plněn benzínem. \\nPříklad: Při použití 10% bude každý válec stále plněn benzínem 10 vstřiků a pak zbývajících 90 vstřiků bude plněn plynem.",
      "gre": "For each gas pressure value the percentage shows the number of petrol injections for each cylinder done every 100 injections on that cylinder. \\nPeriodically the ECU injects petrol on each single cylinder. Using maximum “split” percentage value (25%) one cylinder cyclic will be always fill with petrol. \\nExample: using 10% each single cylinder will be steadily fill with petrol for 10 injections, after that this cylinder will be fill with gas for the last 90 injections.",
      "tha": "สำหรับค่าความดันแก๊สในแต่ละค่า การบอกเป็นเปอร์เซนต์จะบอกถึงจำนวนการหัวฉีดน้ำมันในแต่ละกระบอกสูบที่ทำงานทุกๆ100ครั้งกับกระบอกสูบนั้นๆ /ในทางทฤษฎี ECUจะสั่งให้ฉีดน้ำมันในแต่ละกระบอกสูบ โดยจะแยกเป็นเปอร์เซน (25%) กระบอกสูบหนึงกระบอกจะถูกฉีดด้วยน้ำมันตลอด /ตัวอย่างเช่น ใช้10%ในแต่ละกระบอกสูบ ระบบจะฉีดน้ำมัน10ครั้ง หลังจากนั้นกระบอกสูบจะถูกฉีดด้วยแก๊สอีก 90ครั้ง",
      "geo": "Для каждого значения в векторе PGAS процентное значение введено представляет собой количество впрыскиваемого топлива в каждый цилиндр каждые 100 впрысков, выполняемые на том же цилиндре. \\nБлок управления впрыскивает бензин периодически на цилиндр в отдельности, использовая максимальное значение в процентах для split” (25%) \\nпериодически в каждый цикл один цилиндр будет работать и на бензине. \\n пример если поставить значение 10% то подаётся бензин прогрессивно только в один цилиндр в течение 10 впрысков \\nостальное наполняется газом 90 впрысков"
    },
