      "fra": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "deu": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "spa": "Atencion!!! Quitar la conexion de la siñal de vueltas: revoluciones seran leidas desde inyeccion",
      "por": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "pol": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "ned": "Let op!!! Verwijder de RPM signaaldraad:RPM zal verkregen worden uit de benzine injectietijd.",
      "hun": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "rom": "Atenție!!! Eliminați conexiunea semnalului de turație: tturația va fi obținută din timpul de injecție.",
      "far": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "rus": "Внимание!!! Отсоедините подключение к тахометру, сигнал будет считываться с форсунки",
      "tur": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "heb": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "bul": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "chn": "注意!!!断开转速信号线连接:转速将从燃油喷射信号来获取.",
      "ara": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "ser": "Warning!!! Remove the rpm signal connection: rpm will be obtained from injection times.",
      "cze": "VAROVÁNÍ: odstraňte připojení signálu otáček: otáčky budou získány od vstřikovače.",
      "gre": "Προσοχή!!! Αφαιρέστε την σύνδεση του σήματος στροφών: οι στροφές θα αναγνωστούν από τον ψεκασμό",
